<title>SPAIN: Spain's RTVE joins Telefonica digital plan.</title>
<headline>Spain's RTVE joins Telefonica digital plan.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's state owned Radio Television Espanola (RTVE) has decided to join a digital TV platform being set up by telecommunications operator Telefonica de Espana SA, RTVE said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>The broadcaster said its board of directors had voted eight to four to join the project with the proviso that it be made available to all private or public television channels in the Spanish and Latin American markets.</p>
<p>Telefonica plans to form a new company to develop the platform and offer more than 150 channels of digital television.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom + 34 1 585 2151</p>
</text>
